<h2 class='heading'>What assets are available?</h2>
<hr>
<p class='text'>Currently, the following types of assets are available for download: </p>
<ul>
  <li>Fonts used by the Government</li>
  <li>Photos of all Government staff</li>
  <li>Ministry icons</li>
  <li>Ministry animations (available in both .mp4 and .lottie formats)</li>
  <li>Ministry themes (the short jingles played during ministry animations)</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="heading">Assets list</h2>
<hr>
<p class="text">Click the relevant buttons to download the assets you need! Each category will be downloaded as a .zip file containing the relevant assets.</p>
